        "sourceDisplayName": "Gravekeeper's Cloak",
        "sourceDescription": "Visage generates a layered barrier that protects him from damage.  If he receives damage from a player, one layer is removed, and takes time to recover.<br><br>Visage's Familiars are protected by his cloak when within %radius% range of him, based on the number of layers Visage has.",
