        "sourceDisplayName": "Starbreaker",
        "sourceDescription": "Dawnbreaker whirls her hammer around 3 times, damaging enemies with her attack plus bonus damage. On the final strike, she smashes her hammer down, stunning and damaging enemies in front of her.",
