        "sourceDescription": "Kez has a chance to critically strike the target when attacking with Sais.<br><br>Kez may activate the ability to disarm himself, lock his facing, and parry attacks and attack effects from the targeted direction for %parry_duration% seconds. If an attack is parried from an enemy Hero in this way, that Hero is stunned for %parry_stun_duration%s and gains a Mark.  When a Marked target is attacked by Kez, it will guarantee a critical strike and stun the target.<br><br>The sub-ability may be used to cancel the blocking early.",
